---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy | bestfinancecalculator.com"
  description="Privacy policy details for bestfinancecalculator.com."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold font-display tracking-tight text-main-text text-center">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <div class="mt-8 prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-muted-text space-y-6">
        <p>
          At <strong>bestfinancecalculator.com</strong>, we are committed to protecting your privacy.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>No Financial Data Collection:</strong> All calculations, inputs, and results are processed locally on your device within your web browser using client-side JavaScript. We do not store, collect, or transmit any financial information, mortgage numbers, or loan inputs to our servers.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Usage Statistics:</strong> We may collect anonymous analytics data regarding page views and site performance to improve the user experience.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Cookies:</strong> We use essential cookies for site functionality. We may use third-party advertising services including Google AdSense which use cookies to serve relevant ads based on your visits.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Third-Party Advertising:</strong> We participate in Google AdSense. Google may use cookies to serve ads based on prior visits. Users may opt out via Google's Ad Settings.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Your Rights:</strong> If you are in the UK or EU, you have rights under GDPR including the right to access, correct, or delete any data held about you. Contact us at the Contact page to exercise these rights.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Changes to Policy:</strong> We may update this policy. Continued use of the site constitutes acceptance.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
